OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FDozens of academics at the University
OL,8,Fof Cambridge have signed a letter
OL,9,Fcalling for an independent inquiry
OL,10,Finto the process around the
OL,11,Fappointment of a professor embroiled
OL,12,Fin a high-profile plagiarism row.
OL,14,FThe university confirmed it would be
OL,15,Fcontinuing an investigation into the
OL,16,Fcircumstances surrounding the
OL,17,F"appointment and tenure" of Professor
OL,18,FJason Arday after he quit his position
OL,19,Fon Wednesday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FThe sociology professor's resignation
OL,8,Ffollows a series of media reports
OL,9,Falleging he plagiarised his PHD thesis
OL,10,F- completed at Liverpool John Moores
OL,11,FUniversity - and other research.
OL,13,FOther claims he'd made, including
OL,14,Fsaying he ran 600 miles in six days
OL,15,Fand that he'd raised #5.5 million for
OL,16,Fcharity, have since come under
OL,17,Fscrutiny in the press.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FMultiple academics signed a letter to
OL,8,FCambridge University on Friday, with
OL,9,Forganisers stating that they expected
OL,10,Fthe total number of signatories to
OL,11,Freach one hundred by day's end.
OL,13,FProfessor Priyamvada Gopal, who
OL,14,Fteaches postcolonial studies at
OL,15,FCambridge's English faculty, said the
OL,16,Funiversity should not be allowed to
OL,17,F"mark its own homework".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,F"We're saying that the resignation is
OL,8,Fnot the end of the story, that there
OL,9,Fare potential mistakes and missteps
OL,10,Fmade by the university that need to be
OL,11,Finvestigated," Professor Gopal said.
OL,13,F"We are absolutely clear that the
OL,14,Finvestigation needs to be independent,
OL,15,Fnot in the university's own hands, and
OL,16,Fneeds to be completely transparent and
OL,17,Faccountable to the Cambridge
OL,18,Fcommunity."
OL,20,FThe university has been contacted for
OL,21,Fcomment.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUzD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
