OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FProf Gopal said the letter asks for:
OL,9,F` The circumstances of Prof Arday's
OL,10,Fappointment to be investigated given
OL,11,Fthat it was a "very senior
OL,12,Fappointment" for a professor who was
OL,13,F"at a very early stage of his career".
OL,15,F` Information from the Faculty of
OL,16,FEducation and university
OL,17,Fcommunications team on why the "media
OL,18,Fnarrative" focused "so heavily" on his
OL,19,Frace and his youth, after Prof Arday
OL,20,Fwas appointed as professor of
OL,21,Fsociology of education in 2023.
OL,26,@sD@OOUtD@LO]uD@AOUuD@eO]yD@`OUzD@JO]zD@
OL,26,ATOUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,F` A probe and clear timeline of the
OL,8,Fhandling of plagiarism allegations
OL,9,Fagainst Prof Arday.
OL,11,FProf Gopal also said the academics
OL,12,Fwant to know whether the university
OL,13,Fwas involved in any efforts to deter
OL,14,Fjournalists from reporting on the
OL,15,Fallegations.
OL,17,FThe letter will most likely be handed
OL,18,Fto the vice-chancellor's office by the
OL,19,Fend of the day or first thing on
OL,20,FMonday.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,F"We want the university to note the
OL,8,Fenormous damage that this has done
OL,9,Fboth to Cambridge's own reputation and
OL,10,Fits own academic community, but also
OL,11,Fspecifically to people of colour,"
OL,12,FProf Gopal said.
OL,14,F"We want them to state publicly that
OL,15,Fanti-racism and academic integrity are
OL,16,Fnot mutually exclusive, that they are
OL,17,Fboth necessary and they both work
OL,18,Ftogether."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@bO]vD@AOUzD@JO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/13
