OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FShe added the case has "gone right
OL,8,Finto the ongoing culture war scenario"
OL,9,Fand "acted as a gift to people and
OL,10,Fforces who have been targeting
OL,11,Fequality, diversity, and inclusion in
OL,12,Funiversities for a long time now".
