OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FIt comes as the Metropolitan Police
OL,8,Fhas drawn criticism over an
OL,9,Finvestigation into a claim of
OL,10,Fharassment made against a Times Higher
OL,11,FEducation journalist who emailed Prof
OL,12,FArday with questions some months ago.
OL,14,FCommissioner Sir Mark Rowley told LBC
OL,15,Fon Thursday that the force "dropped
OL,16,Fthe ball on that one", and the report
OL,17,Fshould have been "screened out earlier
OL,18,Fas not requiring investigation".
OL,26,@wD@\OUxD@UO]yD@ROUzD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
