OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FIn a statement earlier on Friday,
OL,8,FCambridge said: "As has been widely
OL,9,Freported, Jason Arday has resigned
OL,10,Ffrom his post at the university with
OL,11,Fimmediate effect.
OL,13,F"Regardless of this, and for
OL,14,Fclarification, the university will
OL,15,Fcontinue to investigate the
OL,16,Fcircumstances around Jason Arday's
OL,17,Fappointment and tenure. The findings
OL,18,Fwill feed into a review of the process
OL,19,Ffor the appointment of senior academic
OL,20,Froles.
OL,26,@pD@QOUuD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
