SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,F"In addition, and as previously
OL,8,Fstated, the university's Research
OL,9,FPolicy Committee will review the
OL,10,Fmisconduct in research policy."
OL,12,FJesus College said previously it was
OL,13,Flaunching its own process in relation
OL,14,Fto the allegation.
OL,16,FAn investigation at Liverpool John
OL,17,FMoores University cleared Prof Arday
OL,18,Fof wrongdoing.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@_O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,FThe professor said in his open
OL,8,Fresignation letter that he felt the
OL,9,F"only way to bring this chapter to an
OL,10,Fend is to step away".
OL,12,FIn the letter, addressed to colleagues
OL,13,Fand published on the Good Law
OL,14,FProject's website, he said: "This
OL,15,Fdecision should not be interpreted as
OL,16,Fa loss of faith in scholarship or in
OL,17,Fthe values that first brought me to
OL,18,FCambridge.
OL,26,@rD@TO]vD@]OU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1786213111
OL,3,CCambridge University faces calls for
OL,4,Cindependent review of appointment
OL,5,Cprocess
OL,7,F"Nor should it be mistaken for an
OL,8,Facceptance of the narratives that have
OL,9,Fsurrounded me.
OL,11,F"It is simply the decision of someone
OL,12,Fwho has reached the limits of what any
OL,13,Fperson should reasonably be expected
OL,14,Fto endure."
OL,16,FHis memoir, Great And Unfortunate
OL,17,FThings, is due to be published by
OL,18,FSimon & Schuster later this month.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@AOUvD@KO]
